Take my yoke upon you.

386
00:38:59,300 --> 00:39:02,360
Let me teach you because I am humble and gentle at heart,

387
00:39:02,360 --> 00:39:05,320
and you will find rest for your souls.

388
00:39:05,320 --> 00:39:08,360
For my yoke is easy to bear,

389
00:39:08,360 --> 00:39:12,040
and the burden I give you is light.

390
00:39:12,040 --> 00:39:12,540
Father,

391
00:39:12,540 --> 00:39:17,120
for each person in this room that's feeling worn out,

392
00:39:17,120 --> 00:39:18,640
tired,

393
00:39:18,640 --> 00:39:19,840
anxious,

394
00:39:19,840 --> 00:39:22,420
God, I don't know,

395
00:39:22,540 --> 00:39:25,600
I don't know what part Sabbath might play in this invitation,

396
00:39:25,600 --> 00:39:34,320
but I pray that they would experience you as one who has a light yoke,

397
00:39:34,320 --> 00:39:35,940
an easy burden.

398
00:39:35,940 --> 00:39:40,200
God, that they would receive rest for their souls

399
00:39:40,200 --> 00:39:45,100
because they are not what they produce or what they consume,

400
00:39:45,200 --> 00:39:47,360
but they are a child of the Most High God.

401
00:39:47,360 --> 00:39:54,260
God, for those of us that have more than enough time on our hands,

402
00:39:54,260 --> 00:40:00,420
may we see that as an asset to come alongside our brothers and sisters in Christ

403
00:40:00,420 --> 00:40:02,840
to help them experience this rest.

404
00:40:08,440 --> 00:40:10,680
And God, may this church be a people

405
00:40:10,680 --> 00:40:17,780
who are day by day learning how to live as God's people in God's world

406
00:40:17,780 --> 00:40:19,860
as we await your ultimate return.

407
00:40:19,860 --> 00:40:23,740
In Jesus' name I pray.

408
00:40:23,740 --> 00:40:25,080
Amen.

409
00:40:25,080 --> 00:40:27,460
All right, church,

410
00:40:27,460 --> 00:40:30,720
there should be some people at the prayer tent if you need prayer.

411
00:40:30,900 --> 00:40:31,620
Other than that,

412
00:40:31,620 --> 00:40:32,360
you are dismissed.

413
00:40:32,360 --> 00:40:32,760
Amen.

414
00:41:00,900 --> 00:41:05,740
Thank you.
